บ Nothing was cracked in the making of this release.                         บ
บ The only thing that got hacked is a perfectly good synthwave sunset.       บ
บ                                                                            บ
บ It started as a vertical music video. People asked if it was 'just AI'.    บ
บ It is not. The music and the sprites are AI-made; the PICTURE is a         บ
บ program: GLSL shaders, ASCII post-pass, raymarched glass, a type engine    บ
บ that slams on the real kick drums. This exe is that program, running       บ
บ live, synced to the audio clock, on whatever display you have.             บ
